<title>UK: Panama prices $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Panama prices $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager BankBoston Corp.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PANAMA</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    13.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.825    PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    99.825    SPREAD	+175 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB+	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  PANAMA    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 31.JAN.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
